    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing our captivating new game, a maze dungeon crawler where your wits and reflexes will be put to the ultimate test! In this thrilling adventure, your primary goal is to reach the end of the maze as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two exciting modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Default Mode:\u00a0</strong>Navigate through the dungeon with enemies in hot pursuit. Your mission is to reach the end of the maze while evading your relentless adversaries. You'll have access to three powerful spells to aid your escape: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Ball:\u00a0</strong>Halves the enemy's speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magma Wall:\u00a0</strong>Blocks the enemy's path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freezing AOE:\u00a0</strong>Freezes the enemy in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Enemy Mode:\u00a0</strong>Similar to Default Mode, but without the enemies. It's all about finding the quickest route to the maze's exit and setting a new record time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treasure coins scattered throughout the maze in both modes. For every 25 coins collected, you gain one health point. Additionally, coins add 600 points to your high score, which is then multiplied by a speed multiplier based on how quickly you complete the dungeon. This determines your total high score.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing our captivating new game, a maze dungeon crawler where your wits and reflexes will be put to the ultimate test! In this thrilling adventure, your primary goal is to reach the end of the maze as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two exciting modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Default Mode:\u00a0</strong>Navigate through the dungeon with enemies in hot pursuit. Your mission is to reach the end of the maze while evading your relentless adversaries. You'll have access to three powerful spells to aid your escape: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Ball:\u00a0</strong>Halves the enemy's speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magma Wall:\u00a0</strong>Blocks the enemy's path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freezing AOE:\u00a0</strong>Freezes the enemy in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Enemy Mode:\u00a0</strong>Similar to Default Mode, but without the enemies. It's all about finding the quickest route to the maze's exit and setting a new record time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treasure coins scattered throughout the maze in both modes. For every 25 coins collected, you gain one health point. Additionally, coins add 600 points to your high score, which is then multiplied by a speed multiplier based on how quickly you complete the dungeon. This determines your total high score.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a thrilling adventure in our maze dungeon crawler! Navigate through mazes, evade enemies with powerful spells, and collect treasure coins for high scores. Test your wits and reflexes to reach the maze's end as quickly as possible!",
